  "description": "In the near future, severe environmental pollution has led to the extinction of numerous livestock species, plunging humanity into a food crisis. Humanity's only salvation lies in the mutants created by pollution and genetic modification. Some humans began producing milk like livestock, prompting the government to establish a system called the ‘Human Dairy Farm’...\n\n *“But... why did I end up like this?”*\n\nEui-Je, who reported the school's obnoxious popular guy, Cassie, as a human cow, somehow finds himself entering that very ranch.\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
